This MIT license covers the Beyond UP RocketPy application code in this
repository (`bup_rocketpy/`, `tests/`, and other files this team wrote).
It does NOT cover everything under `reference/`:

- `reference/openrocket_examples/` contains example `.ork` files taken from
  the OpenRocket project, licensed under the GNU General Public License
  v3 (GPLv3) - see `reference/openrocket_examples/README.md` for the
  source and `LICENSE.OpenRocket` for the full GPLv3 text.
- `reference/prometeo_mission44/` is Beyond UP's own PROMETEO / Mission 44
  reference implementation, separately MIT-licensed - see
  `reference/prometeo_mission44/LICENSE`.
